# Day 34 — Synthesis Optimization

## Objective

The objective of Day 34 was to optimize the RV32I processor RTL using Yosys synthesis passes and generate an optimized gate-level netlist.

---

## Optimization Flow

The following optimization stages were applied:

1. RTL elaboration
2. Process conversion
3. Initial optimization
4. FSM optimization
5. Memory optimization
6. Full RTL optimization
7. Technology mapping
8. Aggressive optimization
9. Unused logic removal
10. Final optimization
11. Design flattening
12. Final cleanup
13. Optimized netlist generation

